# A Rust repository, the way a user starts: init, a package, sync, check, build, run.
run buildrules init . --git {origin} --commit {commit}
config
run buildrules cargo new crates/hello
run buildrules sync
run buildrules check
build //crates/hello:bin //crates/hello:test //crates/hello:lint
expect //crates/hello:bin => Hello, world!
